5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good evening, everyone. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we spend this time getting to know one another. A peaceful start is always preferable.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Let's establish a baseline of behavior. I'll be observing how everyone reacts to the initial uncertainty. Does anyone have a specific strategy?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! This is like a real mystery game! I think we should all be super honest so we can catch the wolf together!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Honesty is a good goal, Rin. I'll just listen for now and see if anyone's words don't quite match their tone.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A delightful start. I shall happily play the role of the polite observer. Let us maintain this civility while we wait for the shadows to speak.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, you seem very focused on observation. I wonder if you have a particular method for spotting a werewolf?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, I look for contradictions and those who try too hard to steer the conversation. Logic is the only reliable tool we have.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, you're so serious! Maybe the wolf is just someone who's really shy? I'll try to make everyone feel happy!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, being happy is nice, but we must stay alert. I agree with Mizuki that logic is important, though we shouldn't be too harsh.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic is a sturdy shield, indeed. However, the most cunning wolves often dress their lies in the finest logic. I shall be watching for the gaps.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, that is a keen point. The gap between intent and expression is where the truth often hides.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,It seems we are all in agreement on the importance of vigilance. I'm curious if anyone feels a particular intuition already?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I don't have a clue yet, but I'm going to keep my eyes wide open! I bet the Seer will find something spooky tonight!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I don't have any suspicions yet. It's too early to judge anyone based on a few sentences.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I find this group quite charming. I have no suspicions, only a curiosity to see whose mask might slip first.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Since we have established our approach, I believe we can conclude for today. I wish you all a restful night.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Let's see what the first divination brings us tomorrow.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Rin,,Goodnight everyone! Sweet dreams! I hope the Seer finds a big clue!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Goodnight. I'll see you all tomorrow.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,A peaceful night to all. I shall retire to my thoughts.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
