36,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good morning. The first night has passed. I believe it is time for us to consider if any information can be shared to guide us.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Now that the Seer has a result, the dynamic changes. @Jonathan, you seem very composed. Do you have anything to tell us?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Rin,,Ooh! Did the Seer find the wolf? Please tell us if you did! I can't wait to know!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Misaki,,It might be dangerous to reveal the role too early. We should think about the risk of the Seer being attacked.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Misaki is quite right. To speak is to invite the wolf's appetite. However, silence allows the wolf to breathe. A delicate balance.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe the risk of silence is currently greater. For the sake of the village, I will reveal myself as the Seer. Mizuki is the werewolf.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, that is a very bold claim. I am a villager. It is highly likely you are the werewolf attempting to frame me immediately.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Rin,,"What?! Mizuki is the wolf? But she seems so smart! Is it true, @Mizuki?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"This is a sudden turn. If Jonathan is the Seer, we've found the wolf. If he's lying, he's just identified himself as the enemy.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"My, what a dramatic revelation! A direct strike on the first day. I wonder if this is a masterstroke of truth or a clumsy bluff.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I have no reason to lie. The divination is absolute. I suggest we act now before the werewolf can cause more harm.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, your ""absolute"" truth is a common tactic for a wolf to secure a quick win. I urge everyone to look at how quickly you've tried to end this.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm so confused! Jonathan is so kind, but Mizuki is so confident! Who do I believe?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, if you are innocent, how do you explain Jonathan's confidence? @Jonathan, are you certain there is no mistake?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, the Seer does not make mistakes in divination. The question is simply whether Jonathan is actually the Seer.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am certain. I trust the village to see the logic in my claim. I vote for Mizuki.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
52,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
53,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I cannot let this lie stand. I vote for Jonathan.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
54,1,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,1,4,talk,Rin,,I trust Jonathan! He's too gentle to lie! I vote for Mizuki!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
56,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
57,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"This is difficult, but Jonathan's willingness to risk himself as Seer is convincing. I vote for Mizuki.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
58,1,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
59,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A fascinating dilemma. However, the weight of the evidence, however fragile, leans toward the Seer's claim. I vote for Mizuki.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
